OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times at
OL,7,Ffirst, but clearing away east during
OL,8,Fthe evening. Dry with some clear
OL,9,Fspells and becoming chilly overnight
OL,10,Fwith a frost in places.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA dry and bright start will
OL,13,Fsoon be followed by outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fspreading east, these becoming heavy.
OL,15,FStrengthening southerly winds with
OL,16,Fgales near the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
